  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8450;</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>Im</mo><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "0",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Now putting the value&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now on comparing both side we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>then&#160;</mtext><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>Im</mo><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
